# VPS deploy

- Production bot runs on the user's **VPS**, not locally.
- Server path: `/opt/discord-nash-bot/DiscordNashBot`
- Service: `discord-nash-bot` (systemd)
- Update after push to `main`: SSH in and run `nashbot-update` (or `bash update.sh`) — git pull, npm ci/build, restart.
- SSH: `root@85.192.41.117` (also `79.137.197.220` — same host). Key: `~/.ssh/id_ed25519`.
- When the user asks to "обновить бота" / "добавь в бота": commit/push needed files to `main`, then SSH and run `nashbot-update` (or `bash update.sh`).
